        "id": 263237,
        "name": "",
        "username": "fjur",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/fjur/{size}/4849_2.png",
        "created_at": "2025-05-18T16:27:16.371Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I also found a couple of websites that list it, but they both list it only as backorders, so I don’t know when or even if they’ll get it back in stock:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.board-game.co.uk/product/branch-claw-expansion-spirit-island/\">https://www.board-game.co.uk/product/branch-claw-expansion-spirit-island/</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.toystreet.co.uk/product/branch-claw-expansion-spirit-island/\" class=\"inline-onebox\">Branch &amp; Claw Expansion: Spirit Island | Toys | Toy Street UK</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Also, FWIW, the <a href=\"https://www.greaterthangames.com/blogs/news/greater-than-games-team-reduced-in-response-to-tariff-crisis\">the announcement</a> about GTG’s reduction / shutdown / whatever you choose to call it did say it part:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>the Greater Than Games website will remain operational, with in-stock products available to order. Goods in the current catalog will still be produced as needed.<br>\n…<br>\nParent company Flat River Group will continue to support its retail and distribution partners through ongoing communication and fulfillment services, as always.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>So this might mean that they’ll do more print runs of already-published products? I really can’t say; the whole thing is full of tons of unknowns, and any speculation would probably be on pretty shaky grounds at best.</p>\n<p>Welcome to the forum, and hope this helps.</p>",
