        "read": false,
        "user_title": "Regular",
        "title_is_group": false,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "I also found a couple of websites that list it, but they both list it only as backorders, so I don't know when or even if they'll get it back in stock:\n* https://www.board-game.co.uk/product/branch-claw-expansion-spirit-island/\n* https://www.toystreet.co.uk/product/branch-claw-expansion-spirit-island/\n\nAlso, FWIW, the [the announcement](https://www.greaterthangames.com/blogs/news/greater-than-games-team-reduced-in-response-to-tariff-crisis) about GTG's reduction / shutdown / whatever you choose to call it did say it part:\n> the Greater Than Games website will remain operational, with in-stock products available to order. Goods in the current catalog will still be produced as needed.\n> ...\n> Parent company Flat River Group will continue to support its retail and distribution partners through ongoing communication and fulfillment services, as always.\n\nSo this might mean that they'll do more print runs of already-published products? I really can't say; the whole thing is full of tons of unknowns, and any speculation would probably be on pretty shaky grounds at best.\n\nWelcome to the forum, and hope this helps.",
